id: pm-jdh1jg
title: "GH-807: make the default eval query set version-controllable in every initialized workspace"
description: "pm eval defaults its curated CI-gate input beneath the blanket-ignored search cache directory, so git silently drops the source-of-truth file and fresh CI clones fail closed."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[7]: "area:cli","area:sdk",ci,eval,gh-issue,git,reproducibility
created_at: "2026-07-29T05:06:11.651Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-29T05:58:29.597Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-29T05:55:42.074Z"
completed_at: "2026-07-29T05:55:42.074Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: A fresh pm init workspace can commit the default eval query-set file without force-adding or editing the managed ignore block; Derived search artifacts remain ignored; Existing initialized workspaces receive an idempotent managed-block repair; pm eval reports an actionable migration when an old default is still ignored; Fresh-clone acceptance and exact repository coverage remain green
parent: pm-5t33or
resolution: Initialized workspaces now keep the default eval query set version-controlled while ignoring generated search artifacts.
