comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T05:06:11.651Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: all-status searches for GH-807 and ignored eval defaults found closed pm-u8n5 claiming an earlier negation plus general init and eval lineages but no active regression owner for restoring a version-controllable default. This item tracks https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/807."
  "2026-07-29T05:55:19.718Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence: initialized workspaces ignore search cache contents rather than the directory, then re-include the curated eval query set. Unit plus fresh-init integration passed; an isolated consumer verified the generated workspace contract and version-controlled-file layout."
